From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mio <mio@mio19.uk>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 19:23:12 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] improve the community map app (overlay/asteroidos)

Apply the CoMaps-inspired patch to asteroid-map, adding offline tile
caching and compass heading orientation for wearable navigation.
